section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>对科学研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能；</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>在学期间学习成绩优秀，本科</span><span><strong><span>总成绩专业排名前20%</span></strong></span><span>；英语水平良好，全国大学英语</span><span><strong><span>六级成绩≥450分或雅思≥6.5分或托福≥80分</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名程序及材料要求</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请进入报名系统：</span></p><p><span>http://yzks.njmu.edu.cn:8080/logon</span></p><p><span>选择“南京医科大学学院开放日报名”进行注册及报名。</span></p><p><span>如实填写个人信息，并同时上传以下材料（注意：提交前请务必认真核对，提交后不得再做更改）：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>南京医科大学公共卫生学院2026年暑期开放日活动申请表（模板见附件1，签字盖章齐全）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>个人简历（1-2页），模板见附件2；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>截至目前的成绩单扫描件（请所在院系教务部门签章并注明专业排名和专业总人数）；</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全国大学英语六级考试成绩单等体现自身英语水平的证明材料扫描件；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>其它体现综合素质的材料，包括：获奖证书，发表学术论文首页或证明，出版物封面及作者页，课题证明等扫描件；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>6</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>身份证、学生证扫描件；</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>注：以上（1）-（6）所提到的材料均需扫描，并按照顺序合成一个PDF文档上传。</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>资格审核</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>审核工作于</span><span><strong><span>7月3日截止</span></strong></span><span>。我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定并公布入选学生名单，请及时查询南京医科大学公共卫生学院官网信息：</span></p><p><span>https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>确定参加线下开放日活动的同学须在指定日期前</span><span><strong><span>按照短信通知要求确认参加，逾期未确认视为自动放弃入选资格。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>注意事项</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></se